From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Backport targeted Wine 11.21 fixes.

Squashed backport of 30 WineHQ commits first released in wine-11.21,
applied in upstream order on top of cx26.3-wine11.0-runeon.31 patches
0001-0163. Test-only hunks are omitted. c37cb58e4c (ntdll),
45f00f925f (win32u) and 98ebfcd75f (winemac.drv) touch ABI-sensitive
modules and are carried with the maintainer's individual approval.
Adaptations, marked [adapted] below: the a358d7ecf1 declaration is placed
after cng_prepare_signature() in crypt32_private.h, which lacks a later
upstream declaration; e90cb1c257 adds only the hint, after CrossOver's
rumble hints, because the base already loads SDL_SetHint; 4751826ecd is
the same one-line change in CrossOver's locked branch of
MMDevCol_Create(); 0568158eca, c56f0edd92 and 0738d528db are the same
lines in the base's fmt case, which upstream reordered in b8b7181ec9;
45f00f925f moves the same two lines above the mutex release in
release_display_manager_ctx(), whose GPU list cleanup differs in the base.

  81db815a81 Alex Henrie: dplayx: Pass bAnsi=FALSE from IDirectPlay4Impl_GetSessionDesc.
  a358d7ecf1 Michael Nelson: crypt32: Preserve authenticated attribute order when verifying signatures. [adapted]
  cd3e9ba0a7 Abdullah Ahmed: user32: Avoid 64-bit value truncation of dialog return values.
  e90cb1c257 Fabien Romano: winebus: Preserve signal handlers when initializing SDL. [adapted]
  3fef3b5d3a James Hawkins: wininet: Delete uncommitted cache file after closing its handle.
  4b2e49fb5a Vishnunithyasoundhar S: comctl32/comboex: Don't pass a NULL string to the CBEN_ENDEDIT notif.
  4751826ecd Alex Henrie: mmdevapi: Fix error check in MMDevCol_Create. [adapted]
  bcff0d4155 Harrison Short: dbghelp: Write minidump on the calling thread.
  21ffe25da3 Sven Baars: gdiplus: Make sure anchor_path is initialized when calling GdipDeletePath() (Coverity).
  0568158eca Anton Baskanov: dmusic: Free the old format in parse_wave_chunk. [adapted]
  c56f0edd92 Anton Baskanov: dmusic: Allocate enough space for WAVEFORMATEX in parse_wave_chunk. [adapted]
  0738d528db Anton Baskanov: dmusic: Check the fmt chunk size in parse_wave_chunk. [adapted]
  45f00f925f James Hawkins: win32u: Call cleanup_devices() before releasing display_device_init_mutex. [adapted]
  d52e0901b5 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: wmp: AddRef returned object in IOleObject::GetClientSite.
  55719ae5f1 Ali Milhim: d3d11: Return E_UNEXPECTED from FinishCommandList() with a NULL command list.
  ca0bb83d63 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: d3d11: Fake success in ID3D10Device1::SetExceptionMode.
  c85f71ce3f Alistair Leslie-Hughes: comsvcs: Correct checking a hex value in guid_from_string.
  70b5903fde Alistair Leslie-Hughes: wininet: Correct sizeof usage in HttpSendRequestExA.
  6f981b85d7 Nikolay Sivov: d2d1: Fix texture object leak on failure path during WIC target initialization.
  9b1eb46383 Nikolay Sivov: d2d1: Avoid accessing potentially reallocated memory.
  9e375e9f93 Nikolay Sivov: d2d1/effect: Fix GetPropertyNameLength() for invalid property index.
  535d68f02a Nikolay Sivov: d2d1/effect: Fix inconsistent cleanup on failure path to create an effect instance.
  7219e03eff Nikolay Sivov: dwrite: Make sure property value pointer is always initialized.
  c37cb58e4c Elizabeth Figura: ntdll: Increase the threadpool worker timeout to 60 seconds.
  dd586289a4 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: dplayx: Call correct interface in IDirectPlayLobby3::Connect.
  98ebfcd75f Owen Rudge: winemac.drv: Advertise PFD_SUPPORT_GDI support.
  7c7438bddb Vitaly Lipatov: gdiplus: Don't loop forever on Bezier curves that can't be flattened.
  088fedbdbc Vitaly Lipatov: gdiplus: Reject a negative offset in GdipDrawCurve3() and GdipDrawCurve3I().
  8de6d2d2a5 Vitaly Lipatov: gdiplus: Close every open figure when converting a path to edges.
  5a66c3e869 Paul Gofman: mmdevapi: Don't try to convert QPC and avoid overflow.

